
  LiteAI  -  Arch Linux ARM that boots straight into pi

  Default login: liteai / liteai   (change it: passwd)

  pi                          the AI session (starts automatically on tty1)
  systemctl status liteai-llama   the local model server (Qwen on llama.cpp)
  nmtui                       connect to Wi-Fi
  sudo pacman -Syu            update the system

